Z||000016||XDrewX||09-29-2001||10:42 PM||||I always park far away, but I only take up one space.  It never fails.....when i come out somebody in a big van or truck is parked right next to me.<BR>I have a love for cars, and I love my cars, I want to keep them as new as possible.<P>I park far away, to try to get away from the Ignorant people, ie. people who let there kids swing the car door open as hard as possible.<P>I have seen too many people dis respect other peoples property. It has nothing to do with keeping your prize in the garage.<P>Heres the kicker.......<P>My wife and I got new cars at the same time.<BR>She parks as close to the front of the lot as possible.<BR>Where as you guys have read already where I park.<P>Guess who has the most door dings, and bumper scrapes.<P>I DO !!!!!! <P>AND SHE NEVER LETS ME FORGET THAT. <P>||||reg||1
Z||000017||dennis_6||09-29-2001||10:50 PM||||Try parking next to the employees with nice cars.  They don't come and go as much and if they have nice vehicles they won't want to take a chance of hurting their precious vehicle.  Usualy you will have to walk a little farther but it is worth it.||||reg||1
Z||000018||Leper||09-30-2001||02:35 AM||||I think the people with huge trucks and vans park next to my fiero to see how much bigger their truck is.<P>There was a lady parked next to me with a 1 ton van with a raised roof. You could stack 3 fieros and they would still be lower than the roofliine on that thing.||||reg||1
Z||000019||Ken Wittlief||09-30-2001||02:41 AM||||Something I forgot to mention. I have gotten into the habit of parking towards the end of the parked cars.<P>Not cause Im worried about my car - but because some people have a hard time getting around and DONT have a handicap permit. <P>  I figure Im in good health and I have no aches or pains - so I leave the close spaces for other who may not be so fortunate. <P>  or maybe its a new mom with a baby in one arm and a big load of pop bottle returns, or some fitness nut who blew out his knee or pulled a muscle in his back.<P> I know most people dont do this, but at least I know if someone is struggling to get to the front door, at least they wont be walking around my car.||||reg||1
